<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Aluar Q1 Sept 30 net $35.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Aluar Q1 Sept 30 net $35.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net $35.7 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company did not provide EPS or revenues for the period.</p>
<p>Q1 results include an extraordinary gain of $11.9 million.</p>
<p>At September 30, net worth stood at $501.9 million. The company reported retained earnings of $143.8 million.</p>
<p>Full company name is Aluar Aluminio Argentino.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
